# Skills and agents installed into the project by the Claude desktop app.
# They are tooling for whoever is editing the course, not part of the course,
# and committing them would publish a few megabytes of somebody else's
# prompts into a repository a reviewer is meant to read in two minutes.
.claude/skills/
.agents/
